#AREA Griffon Bank & Travel~
#AUTHORS Presto~





#HELPS
-1 GRIFFON AIRLINE BANK~
Griffon Bank & Travel contains two parts: The Bank and the Airline.

The Bank:
  These commands can be used in the bank:
  bank balance                    (default value if you just type "bank")
  bank deposit <amount>           (maximum gold you can hold in your account
  bank withdraw <amount>           is determined by: (level + number of rooms
  bank transfer <amount> <to_who>  in your castle) * 2 million)

The Airline:
  A fast, convenient (although expensive) method of travel from one major 
  city to another.  Cost is determined by the level of your character, the
  distance to be traveled, and whether you're a frequent flyer.  To use
  Griffon Airlines, just say the name of your destination while on the roof
  of the Bank (that's where the griffons take off and land.)

  (A) Map of the airways flown by Griffon Airlines.
  (-) Back

{a}AIRLINEMAP
{-}PRESTO
~
-1 AIRLINEMAP~
The map:          {050}Mist City{010}_{300}
                     {010}/      \__{050}Ocean City{300}
                    {010}/             |{300}
                   {010}/              |{300}
                  {010}/           ___{050}Ofcol{010}____{300}
              {010}___{050}Kytar{010}_______/      |     \___         _{050}Sun Dome{010}__   {050}Waterdeep{300}
{010}---         _/     |                |         \      _/           \__     /{300}
{010}   \       /       |                |        _{050}Chakkor                {010}\_   |{300} 
{050}Elven City{010}_       |                |     __/      \                   {050}Midgaard{300}
           {010}\      |                |    /          \           ________/{300}
            {050}Mount Kolvir         {050}Entropy            {010}\         /{300}
                        {010}\       /   |               {050}Refuge Tribe{010}_{300}
                         {050}Pompeii    {010}|                            \ {300}
                                    {010}|                ________{050}Sarglam{300}
                                    {010}|       ________/{300}
                                  {050}Antarctica{300}
  (-) Back

{-}GRIFFON AIRLINE BANK
~
0 $~




#RANGES 0 99 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#16000
banker~
The Banker~
The banker is here, ready to assist you.~
This human wears a pressed robe, which seems to shine with a light golden
aura.  He's tall, with large muscles from dealing with all the gold.  His
warm smile and strong physique almost guarantee your gold is safe with him.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+9999 1d1+99
387913 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpforce $n bank balance
~
|
#16001
griffon mist city~
The Griffon~
The griffon relaxes here, basking in the sun.~
The griffon is humongous.  On his saddle you see the price listing:

  Ocean City:   58,000
  Kytar:       108,000~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+9999 1d1+99
10000 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>speech_prog p ocean city~
if level($n) < 20 
or quest(5,9,$n) == 500
  if goldamt($n) < 14500
    tell $n You need 14,500 coins.
    break
  else
    mpmadd $n gold -14500
  endif
else
  if goldamt($n) < 58000
    tell $n You need 58,000 coins.
    break
  else
    mpmadd $n gold -58000
    mpmadd $n quest 5 9 1
  endif
endif
mptransfer $n 16099
mpecho $n mounts the griffon and takes off for Ocean City.
mpgoto 16099
mpecho You mount a griffon and take off for Ocean City.
mpecho The flight isn't that long, but all you really see along the
mpecho way is the mist-covered ocean.  You have arrived at Ocean City.
mpat 16003 mpecho $n arrives on a griffon.
mptransfer $n 16003
mpat 16003 mpforce $n look
tell $n Thank you for flying Griffon Airlines.
mpgoto 16001
~
>speech_prog p kytar~
if level($n) < 20 
or quest(5,9,$n) == 500
  if goldamt($n) < 27000
    tell $n You need 27,000 coins.
    break
  else
    mpmadd $n gold -27000
  endif
else
  if goldamt($n) < 108000
    tell $n You need 108,000 coins.
    break
  else
    mpmadd $n gold -108000
    mpmadd $n quest 5 9 1
  endif
endif
mptransfer $n 16099
mpecho $n mounts the griffon and takes off for Kytar.
mpgoto 16099
mpecho You mount a griffon and take off for Kytar.
mpecho The flight is fairly long, and all you really see along the
mpecho way is the ocean far below.  You have arrived at Kytar.
mpat 16007 mpecho $n arrives on a griffon.
mptransfer $n 16007
mpat 16007 mpforce $n look
tell $n Thank you for flying Griffon Airlines.
mpgoto 16001
~
